    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d327">

                <pb facs="0406" n="294" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg294"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.51/253</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Minister in Cuba</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Gonzales</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-08-02T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 2, 1917, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your July 28, 11 a.m. What information referred to in Department’s July 13, noon
                    [July 19, 4 p.m.] have you received from Cuban Government as to loan?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
